# notes/

Shared memory between agents and the user: what we're doing, why, and what's running.

- `HANDOFF.md`: current state. Read first, update when it changes. Keep under ~50 lines.
- `EXPERIMENTS.md`: append one entry per experiment (template at top). Never rewrite old entries.
- `decisions/`: one short file per decision and its reason.
- `SERVERS.md`: hosts, envs, data paths.
- `supervisor/`: supervisor messages and ideas.
- `archive/`: old material. Read only when needed.

Rules: be terse, no padding, link to `results/` instead of copying data.
# Handoff

Current state only. Keep short; move finished work to `EXPERIMENTS.md`.

## Now

- Method: shared 8×4 source table (`--source_architecture shared`) in
  `models/WFM-InformedSource/guided_diffusion/source.py`. Verified to match
  the spec: exp(logits), per-sample selection of the 3 available modalities,
  per-subband normalization, weighted sum per band, 8 bands stacked.
- Submitted: eight seed-43 learned runs, uniform/random × sigma 0/0.5 per host.
  Mostafa B=1: array1085 complete. Hendrix corrected B=4 A100: array8753,
  completion8754; four distinct patients/four targets per update (see below).
  Each run: 10k updates, full219 validation, one Euler step, eval seed42.
  [Run locations](../results/shared32-seed43-b1b4-20261108/RUN_LOCATIONS.csv).
- Nov8 ~09:12: Mostafa seed43/44 B=1 all eight complete; full219/four-target
  metrics verified and backed up locally. All four seed45 B=1 runs training.
  Exact `ssh hendrix` works; backup transport fixed to use normal SSH on Hendrix.
  B1 untouched. Local backups require the PC awake; original monitor now267894.
  [Latest checks](../results/shared32-overnight-20261108/run_registry.json).
- Overnight extension authorized: Mostafa seed44 B=1, uniform/random × sigma0/0.5,
  same frozen code/settings. Jobs1090_0,1091_1,1092_2,1093_3 depend afterany on
  corresponding seed43 tasks; completion1094. Backup complete; PID215446 exited.
  Seed44 all four complete and verified; no failed predecessor or manual retry.
  Seed45 also queued:1095_0,1096_1,1097_2,1098_3 after corresponding seed44
  tasks; completion1099, separate local backup PID223334. Eight extra jobs total.
  Every30min checks active until Nov8 noon. No further cohorts or combinations.
  [Overnight registry](../results/shared32-overnight-20261108/run_registry.json).
- After seed45, eight metrics-only evaluations test1/2 available inputs:1100_0–
  1107_7, finish1108; each afterok its model's parent. No new training/volumes.
  Separate backup PID229940; paired masks and full219 metrics checked by callback.
- Biased is dropped for the shared table: `decisions/biased-shared-table.md`.
- B4 correction: distinct scan IDs can share a patient (`-000`/`-001`). Original
  8611 stopped before predicted collisions; no collision was observed. Partial
  logs archived separately. Patient-aware fix passes review, CPU/full10k replay,
  A10040GB smoke +50-update memory check;8753 all four actively training.
  [Provenance](../results/shared32-seed43-b4-patientfixed-20261108/replacement_provenance.json).
- Other user experiments may run on clusters outside this log.

## Open

- Results pending for the eight-run comparison. Larger multi-seed sweep cancelled.
  Reuse historical B=1 mean/Gaussian references; no matched B=4 mean was launched.

